[ve:0.2.3]
[00:11.124]I learned to smile with my teeth clenched tight
[00:16.642]Gold on my tongue, steel in my spine
[00:22.584]They call it luck, I call it work
[00:28.280]I don’t survive — I rise every time
[00:35.713]I don’t wait for doors to open
[00:38.263]I make them nervous till they do
[00:41.193]If I look flawless under pressure
[00:44.103]It’s because pressure taught me how to move
[00:47.633]I don’t fall apart
[00:50.503]I don’t crack in view
[00:53.566]If I’m breaking
[00:56.180]You’ll never know the truth
[01:01.410]I was built to shine
[01:03.320]Even when it hurts
[01:06.679]I wear my hunger like a crown
[01:09.847]And make it work
[01:12.294]I was built to shine
[01:15.480]Not to be enough — to win
[01:18.765]If love is power
[01:20.490]Then I learned
[01:21.753]How to discipline it
[01:26.220]They say relax, like that’s a cure
[01:29.156]Like letting go won’t cost me ground
[01:32.194]I don’t trust comfort, I trust control
[01:35.134]Soft hands don’t hold the world down
[01:37.701]Every step is calculated
[01:40.460]Every breath a silent vow
[01:43.215]If I ever look like I’m glowing
[01:46.389]That’s the armor doing its job
[01:50.181]I don’t beg
[01:51.628]I don’t plead
[01:53.174]I perform
[01:54.390]And I succeed
[01:58.211]I was built to shine
[02:02.181]Under lights that burn
[02:04.564]I turn fear into fuel
[02:08.639]And let it churn
[02:11.852]I was built to shine
[02:14.950]Even starving for more
[02:17.269]I don’t need permission
[02:19.795]I decide
[02:21.60]What I’m worth
[02:24.822]Silk voice
[02:26.413]Sharp design
[02:27.905]Say my name
[02:29.213]Watch me climb
[02:30.848]Sweet on the surface
[02:32.204]Perfectly staged
[02:33.563]But I don’t forget
[02:34.823]What hunger made
[02:39.908]🎵
[02:50.265]I was built to shine
[02:53.130]Not to fade out slow
[02:56.852]If I’m flawless
[02:58.255]It’s because I learned
[02:59.748]What to show
[03:02.930]I was built to shine
[03:04.481]With my teeth in the knife
[03:07.830]I don’t dream of safety
[03:10.327]I earn
[03:12.288]My life
[03:19.950]I don’t need saving.
[03:22.997]I need space.
[03:26.411]And I take it.